674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XQ3evODwJAwQ7kNvwG-Bb_R&_nc_oc=AdrESQ9EKs8Z2Dkc0pZEXGj7Nij1gSs7QxXcg5SzQH3er2cMvz9Cexcl683sUprMfW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLS0st7HbbNTQA7AZPEl-XqJw5lPyWa2ReVa-v9Onuztg&oe=6AA01C59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3LyPtl0mTgAQ7kNvwHVd3ul&_nc_oc=AdrxGm_szAOTumcLE1v9ZejpdZluhdZFphS4JV0YjRxyssmKxEeOwjCFI0F6buLQRCI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIy79tak6Eqw5Q1FjIpqEDhBj6YWbEHXvRRCeyxEu27iA&oe=6AA02516"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9G3Xo41s6IgQ7kNvwGCIY3D&_nc_oc=AdoJW16CcXIYS7ZDiQDvi_rubKTmIMEUJTURKxObvZ7MGPuzhF426negZC708yzBXqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKsjgziUF0ORMkbBEACmazJjYBj1C7Yx_GH94UbHtowTg&oe=6AA02131"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip